---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../site.config";
---

<BaseLayout title="关于" description="关于本博客">
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 via-white to-purple-50 dark:from-zinc-900 dark:via-zinc-900 dark:to-zinc-800 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-zinc-800/70 rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 sm:p-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-6">
          关于我
        </h1>

        <div class="prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
          <p class="text-lg text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mb-6">
            欢迎来到 <strong class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">{site.title}</strong>！
          </p>

          <p class="text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 mb-4">
            这里是我记录技术学习、生活感悟的地方。主要分享：
          </p>

          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 space-y-2 mb-6">
            <li>后端开发（Java、Go、Spring）</li>
            <li>数据库与缓存（MySQL、Redis、ES）</li>
            <li>技术面试经验</li>
            <li>其他感兴趣的技术话题</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-700/50 rounded-lg p-6 mt-8">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">联系方式</h3>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
              <a href="/sponsor" class="text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-700">☕ 赞赏支持</a>
              <a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/wincy" target="_blank" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700">Buy Me a Coffee</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>